  "body": "Positioned on the fifth and top floor, this exceptional two-bedroom, two-bathroom penthouse offers the prestige, privacy, and elevation of true penthouse living within the tightly held The Gardens at Kensington Park.\r\n\r\nOffered to the market for the first time, this premium penthouse is one of only two apartments with this unique layout, making it a rare and compelling opportunity. \r\n\r\nExpansive floor-to-ceiling windows flood the home with natural light and warmth throughout the day, enhancing the elevated outlook and creating a bright, welcoming atmosphere year-round.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living and dining area is framed by triple-stacked sliding doors, opening seamlessly to an expansive entertainers' deck, ideal for relaxed afternoons, hosting family and friends, or simply enjoying the elevated outlook from above. This seamless indoor-outdoor connection elevates the home well beyond typical apartment living.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the residence is the beautifully appointed kitchen, finished in a warm lime-washed oak palette, complete with Miele appliances and a beautiful stone benchtop.  The interior is calm and timeless, suited to downsizers seeking quality, comfort and ease.  A discreet, integrated laundry, private entrance hallway, and thoughtful separation between living and bedroom zones further enhance functionality.  Completing the offering are two secure basement car parks and a dedicated storage locker, easily accessible via the secure building lift.\r\n\r\nDesigned for low-maintenance, lock-and-leave living, this penthouse sits within a predominantly owner-occupied building and offers access to Kensington Park's established neighbourhood amenities, landscaped grounds, and walking trails, with Orewa Beach and the town center just moments away.\r\n\r\nExceptionally priced at $1,520,000, this is a premium opportunity that will attract immediate interest.\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this caliber are limited and will not last.  \r\n\r\nVisit our open homes or call one of our dedicated team members and discover why Kensington Park remains Orewa's most sought-after address for those who value a coastal lifestyle seamlessly blended with quality, community, and peace of mind.",
